# OpenMS ElutionPeakDetection made LOCK-FREE for SpeXtract's nested band-parallel calls.
# Removes the program-global critical OPENMS_ElutionPeakDetection_mtraces (per-thread accumulation
# in detectPeaks(vector); serial nested path into the caller's own vector). Combined with the
# ms1_traces canonical sort in spextract (determinism fix), the whole tool is now
# bit-deterministic: verified 1,528,113 spectra / 10,036 peptides IDENTICAL on node-1 and node-2
# (different thread scheduling). Supersedes openms-epd-no-nested-parallel.patch.
